        "created_at": "2014-08-06T02:08:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can tell you there's no such thing as \"simultaneous\" or \"static effect\" in the SotM digital version. &nbsp;I still need to get that blog post about the damage dealing algorithm written up… probably in some of my copious free time&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/cry.png?v=9\" title=\":cry:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cry:\"></p>",
